{"seq":3,"slug":"firmware-security-ota","title":"固件安全与 OTA 更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/firmware-security-ota","wordCount":1973,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"固件安全与-ota-更新\">固件安全与 OTA 更新</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>固件一旦出厂就暴露在物理与远程的双重威胁之下，其安全与可升级性直接决定设备能否长期可靠地运行。本文围绕四条主线展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>威胁模型</strong>：从物理攻击、远程入侵到供应链篡改，明确设备要防的是哪几类对手</li>\n<li><strong>安全启动</strong>：以不可篡改的 ROM 为信任根，逐级用签名验证建立信任链</li>\n<li><strong>OTA 更新</strong>：双分区架构加断电安全的更新流程，实现可靠回滚与防降级</li>\n<li><strong>安全编码</strong>：内存防护手段与 MISRA C 规则集在编码阶段消除常见漏洞</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"固件安全威胁模型\">固件安全威胁模型</h2><p>嵌入式设备面临的安全威胁贯穿固件的全生命周期——从开发阶段的代码泄露，到部署后的物理攻击和远程入侵。建立系统化的安全架构是保护设备和用户数据的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    THREAT[安全威胁] --&gt; PHYSICAL[物理攻击]&#10;    THREAT --&gt; REMOTE[远程攻击]&#10;    THREAT --&gt; SUPPLY[供应链攻击]&#10;    PHYSICAL --&gt; JTAG_ATK[JTAG/SWD 未锁定]&#10;    PHYSICAL --&gt; DUMP[Flash 内容转储]&#10;    PHYSICAL --&gt; GLITCH[电压/时钟毛刺]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt; INJECT[恶意固件注入]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt; REPLAY[固件回滚攻击]&#10;    REMOTE --&gt; OVERFLOW[缓冲区溢出]&#10;    SUPPLY --&gt; TAMPER[固件篡改]&#10;    SUPPLY --&gt; COUNTERFEIT[仿冒固件]\">graph TD\n    THREAT[安全威胁] --&gt; PHYSICAL[物理攻击]\n    THREAT --&gt; REMOTE[远程攻击]\n    THREAT --&gt; SUPPLY[供应链攻击]\n    PHYSICAL --&gt; JTAG_ATK[JTAG/SWD 未锁定]\n    PHYSICAL --&gt; DUMP[Flash 内容转储]\n    PHYSICAL --&gt; GLITCH[电压/时钟毛刺]\n    REMOTE --&gt; INJECT[恶意固件注入]\n    REMOTE --&gt; REPLAY[固件回滚攻击]\n    REMOTE --&gt; OVERFLOW[缓冲区溢出]\n    SUPPLY --&gt; TAMPER[固件篡改]\n    SUPPLY --&gt; COUNTERFEIT[仿冒固件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁类别</th>\n<th>攻击手段</th>\n<th>防御措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固件逆向</td>\n<td>JTAG 读取 Flash</td>\n<td>读保护（RDP）锁定调试接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码篡改</td>\n<td>物理替换 Flash 芯片</td>\n<td>安全启动 + 代码签名验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固件降级</td>\n<td>安装旧版有漏洞固件</td>\n<td>版本号单调递增校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据窃取</td>\n<td>侧信道/探针攻击</td>\n<td>加密存储敏感数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程攻击</td>\n<td>缓冲区溢出</td>\n<td>MPU 隔离 + 栈保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间人</td>\n<td>OTA 传输拦截</td>\n<td>TLS 加密通道 + 固件签名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全启动链\">安全启动链</h2><h3 id=\"信任根\">信任根</h3><p>安全启动（Secure Boot）建立从硬件到应用程序的信任链：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ROM Bootloader（不可篡改）</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>验证</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Bootloader</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>验证</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Application</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROM Bootloader}（不可篡改） \\xrightarrow{\\text{验证}} \\text{Bootloader} \\xrightarrow{\\text{验证}} \\text{Application}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROM Bootloader</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（不可篡改）</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">验证</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bootloader</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">验证</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Application</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant ROM as ROM Boot&lt;br/&gt;(信任根)&#10;    participant BL as Bootloader&#10;    participant APP as Application&#10;    participant KEY as 公钥存储&lt;br/&gt;(OTP/Flash)&#10;&#10;    ROM-&gt;&gt;KEY: 读取公钥哈希&#10;    ROM-&gt;&gt;BL: 读取 Bootloader 镜像&#10;    ROM-&gt;&gt;ROM: 验证签名(RSA/ECDSA)&#10;    ROM-&gt;&gt;BL: 签名有效 → 跳转执行&#10;    BL-&gt;&gt;KEY: 读取应用公钥&#10;    BL-&gt;&gt;APP: 读取 Application 镜像&#10;    BL-&gt;&gt;BL: 验证签名&#10;    BL-&gt;&gt;APP: 签名有效 → 跳转执行\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant ROM as ROM Boot&lt;br/&gt;(信任根)\n    participant BL as Bootloader\n    participant APP as Application\n    participant KEY as 公钥存储&lt;br/&gt;(OTP/Flash)\n\n    ROM-&gt;&gt;KEY: 读取公钥哈希\n    ROM-&gt;&gt;BL: 读取 Bootloader 镜像\n    ROM-&gt;&gt;ROM: 验证签名(RSA/ECDSA)\n    ROM-&gt;&gt;BL: 签名有效 → 跳转执行\n    BL-&gt;&gt;KEY: 读取应用公钥\n    BL-&gt;&gt;APP: 读取 Application 镜像\n    BL-&gt;&gt;BL: 验证签名\n    BL-&gt;&gt;APP: 签名有效 → 跳转执行</pre><h3 id=\"密码学基础设施\">密码学基础设施</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>安全强度</th>\n<th>MCU 硬件支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SHA-256</td>\n<td>完整性校验</td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>STM32 HASH 外设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ECDSA P-256</td>\n<td>固件签名验证</td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>STM32 PKA 外设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AES-128/256</td>\n<td>固件加密</td>\n<td>128/256 位</td>\n<td>STM32 AES/CRYP 外设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RSA-2048</td>\n<td>固件签名（传统）</td>\n<td>112 位</td>\n<td>软件实现或 PKA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMAC-SHA256</td>\n<td>消息认证码</td>\n<td>128 位</td>\n<td>HASH + 软件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"读保护级别\">读保护级别</h3><p>STM32 的读保护（RDP）机制防止未授权 Flash 访问：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RDP 级别</th>\n<th>调试器访问</th>\n<th>Flash 读取</th>\n<th>回退可能</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Level 0</td>\n<td>完全开放</td>\n<td>开放</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>开发阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 1</td>\n<td>连接时 Flash 不可读</td>\n<td>运行时正常</td>\n<td>可回退（擦除 Flash）</td>\n<td>产品保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Level 2</td>\n<td>完全禁用 JTAG/SWD</td>\n<td>运行时正常</td>\n<td>不可逆</td>\n<td>最高安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Level 2 为不可逆操作：一旦设置，芯片永远无法通过调试接口访问</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Level 2 为不可逆操作}：\\text{一旦设置，芯片永远无法通过调试接口访问}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Level 2 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为不可逆操作</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一旦设置，芯片永远无法通过调试接口访问</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"ota-固件更新\">OTA 固件更新</h2><h3 id=\"更新架构\">更新架构</h3><p>OTA（Over-The-Air）更新允许远程升级设备固件，是物联网设备生命周期管理的核心能力。主流方案采用双分区（Dual-Bank）架构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Flash 布局&#10;        BL[Bootloader&lt;br/&gt;0x08000000&lt;br/&gt;固定不更新]&#10;        SLOT_A[Slot A: 运行分区&lt;br/&gt;0x08020000&lt;br/&gt;当前固件]&#10;        SLOT_B[Slot B: 下载分区&lt;br/&gt;0x08080000&lt;br/&gt;新固件暂存]&#10;        META[元数据区&lt;br/&gt;版本号/标志/CRC]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 更新流程&#10;        DL[下载新固件到 Slot B] --&gt; VERIFY[验证签名+CRC]&#10;        VERIFY --&gt; FLAG[设置更新标志]&#10;        FLAG --&gt; REBOOT[系统重启]&#10;        REBOOT --&gt; BL_CHECK[Bootloader 检查标志]&#10;        BL_CHECK --&gt; SWAP[交换/跳转新固件]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Flash 布局\n        BL[Bootloader&lt;br/&gt;0x08000000&lt;br/&gt;固定不更新]\n        SLOT_A[Slot A: 运行分区&lt;br/&gt;0x08020000&lt;br/&gt;当前固件]\n        SLOT_B[Slot B: 下载分区&lt;br/&gt;0x08080000&lt;br/&gt;新固件暂存]\n        META[元数据区&lt;br/&gt;版本号/标志/CRC]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 更新流程\n        DL[下载新固件到 Slot B] --&gt; VERIFY[验证签名+CRC]\n        VERIFY --&gt; FLAG[设置更新标志]\n        FLAG --&gt; REBOOT[系统重启]\n        REBOOT --&gt; BL_CHECK[Bootloader 检查标志]\n        BL_CHECK --&gt; SWAP[交换/跳转新固件]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"更新策略对比\">更新策略对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>Flash 需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双分区交换</td>\n<td>A/B 分区互换角色</td>\n<td>可靠回滚</td>\n<td>需 2× 应用空间</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双分区覆写</td>\n<td>B 验证后覆写 A</td>\n<td>节省空间</td>\n<td>覆写失败风险</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量更新</td>\n<td>仅传输差分补丁</td>\n<td>带宽最小</td>\n<td>需差分算法支持</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单分区+外部 Flash</td>\n<td>外部暂存+内部覆写</td>\n<td>内部 Flash 紧凑</td>\n<td>依赖外部硬件</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"断电安全\">断电安全</h3><p>OTA 更新必须考虑任何时刻的断电恢复：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>原子性保证：更新要么完全成功，要么回滚到旧版本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{原子性保证}：\\text{更新要么完全成功，要么回滚到旧版本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原子性保证</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">更新要么完全成功，要么回滚到旧版本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键设计要素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>标志位后置</strong>：固件完全写入并验证后才设置&quot;更新就绪&quot;标志</li>\n<li><strong>确认机制</strong>：新固件首次启动后执行自检，通过后设置&quot;确认&quot;标志</li>\n<li><strong>回滚窗口</strong>：若新固件未在 N 次启动内确认，自动回滚到旧版本</li>\n<li><strong>写入校验</strong>：每写入一页立即回读验证，异常时标记该页重试</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"版本管理\">版本管理</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>版本格式：Major.Minor.Patch（语义化版本）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{版本格式}：\\text{Major.Minor.Patch}（语义化版本）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">版本格式</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Major.Minor.Patch</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（语义化版本）</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>变更含义</th>\n<th>OTA 策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Major</td>\n<td>不兼容的接口变更</td>\n<td>可能需要特殊迁移流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minor</td>\n<td>向后兼容的新功能</td>\n<td>标准 OTA 流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patch</td>\n<td>Bug 修复</td>\n<td>标准 OTA 流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>防止降级攻击：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>新版本号</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>当前版本号（</mtext><mi>O</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mtext>计数器单调递增）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{新版本号} &gt; \\text{当前版本号}（OTP 计数器单调递增）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新版本号</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前版本号</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">计数器单调递增）</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"bootloader-设计\">Bootloader 设计</h2><h3 id=\"最小-bootloader\">最小 Bootloader</h3><p>Bootloader 是 OTA 系统的信任锚点，其核心职责：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>检查更新标志/条件</li>\n<li>验证固件完整性（CRC/哈希）和真实性（签名）</li>\n<li>执行固件交换或跳转</li>\n<li>处理回滚逻辑</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bootloader 设计原则：越简单越安全，代码越少漏洞越少</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bootloader 设计原则}：\\text{越简单越安全，代码越少漏洞越少}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bootloader </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设计原则</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">越简单越安全，代码越少漏洞越少</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"应用跳转\">应用跳转</h3><p>Bootloader 跳转到应用程序的关键步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>关闭所有中断和外设</li>\n<li>重设 MSP 为应用向量表中的初始栈值</li>\n<li>设置 VTOR 为应用向量表地址</li>\n<li>跳转到应用的 Reset_Handler</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>跳转地址</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>∗</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>APP_BASE</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（Reset_Handler 地址）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{跳转地址} = *(\\text{APP\\_BASE} + 4) \\quad \\text{（Reset\\_Handler 地址）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跳转地址</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">APP_BASE</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">Reset_Handler </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地址）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"mcuboot-标准\">MCUboot 标准</h3><p>MCUboot 是 Linux 基金会维护的开源安全 Bootloader：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>MCUboot 支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>安全启动</td>\n<td>RSA/ECDSA 签名验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加密固件</td>\n<td>AES-CTR/AES-CBC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚保护</td>\n<td>硬件安全计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区方案</td>\n<td>Swap / Overwrite / Direct-XIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTOS 集成</td>\n<td>Zephyr / FreeRTOS / Mbed OS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"传输安全\">传输安全</h2><h3 id=\"通信加密\">通信加密</h3><p>OTA 固件下载的传输层安全：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>保护内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输加密</td>\n<td>TLS 1.3 / DTLS</td>\n<td>防窃听、防篡改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固件加密</td>\n<td>AES-256-CBC</td>\n<td>防止逆向工程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固件签名</td>\n<td>ECDSA P-256</td>\n<td>防止伪造/篡改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完整性校验</td>\n<td>SHA-256</td>\n<td>检测传输错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"证书管理\">证书管理</h3><p>设备端存储的安全凭证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>设备证书</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>设备私钥</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>CA 根证书</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>安全存储区</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{设备证书} + \\text{设备私钥} + \\text{CA 根证书} \\rightarrow \\text{安全存储区}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设备证书</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设备私钥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">根证书</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">安全存储区</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Flash 明文</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>原型开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flash + RDP</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>消费电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTP 区域</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>唯一 ID/密钥哈希</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全元件（SE）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>额外硬件</td>\n<td>支付/工业安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TrustZone 隔离</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需 M33+</td>\n<td>软件安全区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"安全编码实践\">安全编码实践</h2><h3 id=\"内存安全\">内存安全</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御措施</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>栈 Canary</td>\n<td>检测栈缓冲区溢出</td>\n<td>-fstack-protector</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MPU 保护</td>\n<td>禁止栈区代码执行</td>\n<td>XN 属性设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界检查</td>\n<td>防止数组越界</td>\n<td>手动长度校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全库函数</td>\n<td>替代不安全的 C 库函数</td>\n<td>strncpy 替代 strcpy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>编译期检测潜在漏洞</td>\n<td>MISRA C 规则集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"misra-c-关键规则\">MISRA C 关键规则</h3><p>MISRA C 是汽车和安全关键领域的 C 语言编码标准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则类别</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>安全意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>禁止隐式类型转换</td>\n<td>防止数据截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指针安全</td>\n<td>限制指针运算</td>\n<td>防止野指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制流</td>\n<td>switch 必须有 default</td>\n<td>防止未处理情况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未定义行为</td>\n<td>禁止有符号溢出假设</td>\n<td>确保行为可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源管理</td>\n<td>禁止动态内存分配</td>\n<td>消除碎片和泄漏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MISRA C 2012：</mtext><mn>143</mn><mtext> 条规则</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext> 条指导方针</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MISRA C 2012}：143 \\text{ 条规则} + 16 \\text{ 条指导方针}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MISRA C 2012</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">：</span><span class=\"mord\">143</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">条规则</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">条指导方针</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>安全关键系统（SIL 3/4、ASIL C/D）要求 100% 遵从必需规则、90%+ 遵从推荐规则，偏差需书面记录和审核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>威胁与防御</strong>：物理攻击（JTAG 读取、转储、毛刺）、远程攻击（固件注入、回滚、溢出）与供应链篡改各有对应防线，RDP 读保护是保护 Flash 的第一道闸。</li>\n<li><strong>安全启动</strong>：以不可篡改的 ROM 为信任根，用 RSA/ECDSA 逐级验证 Bootloader 与应用，签名与哈希通常由 PKA/HASH 外设加速。</li>\n<li><strong>OTA 更新</strong>：双分区交换提供可靠回滚，代价是 2 倍应用空间；标志位后置、启动自检确认与回滚窗口共同保证任何时刻断电都能原子恢复。</li>\n<li><strong>防降级与传输安全</strong>：版本号单调递增配合 OTP 计数器阻断回滚攻击，TLS 通道、固件加密与签名分别防窃听、防逆向和防篡改。</li>\n<li><strong>安全编码</strong>：栈 Canary、MPU 保护与安全库函数消除内存漏洞，MISRA C 从类型、指针、控制流层面约束未定义行为。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"固件安全与 OTA 更新","id":"固件安全与-ota-更新"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"固件安全威胁模型","id":"固件安全威胁模型"},{"level":2,"text":"安全启动链","id":"安全启动链"},{"level":3,"text":"信任根","id":"信任根"},{"level":3,"text":"密码学基础设施","id":"密码学基础设施"},{"level":3,"text":"读保护级别","id":"读保护级别"},{"level":2,"text":"OTA 固件更新","id":"ota-固件更新"},{"level":3,"text":"更新架构","id":"更新架构"},{"level":3,"text":"更新策略对比","id":"更新策略对比"},{"level":3,"text":"断电安全","id":"断电安全"},{"level":3,"text":"版本管理","id":"版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Bootloader 设计","id":"bootloader-设计"},{"level":3,"text":"最小 Bootloader","id":"最小-bootloader"},{"level":3,"text":"应用跳转","id":"应用跳转"},{"level":3,"text":"MCUboot 标准","id":"mcuboot-标准"},{"level":2,"text":"传输安全","id":"传输安全"},{"level":3,"text":"通信加密","id":"通信加密"},{"level":3,"text":"证书管理","id":"证书管理"},{"level":2,"text":"安全编码实践","id":"安全编码实践"},{"level":3,"text":"内存安全","id":"内存安全"},{"level":3,"text":"MISRA C 关键规则","id":"misra-c-关键规则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"性能分析与功耗优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/debugging-optimization/performance-power-optimization"},"next":null}